<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 4-7.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 4-7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>4-7 at 1000GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to</p>
<p>a German mark.</p>
<p>	  April 4-7     April 3/4</p>
<p> CZK	0.4644	  0.46414</p>
<p> DKK	2.09855	 2.0979</p>
<p> FIM	2.66919	 2.66624</p>
<p> HUF	0.07589	 0.07592</p>
<p> JPY	0.10816	 0.10892</p>
<p> LTL	3.3961	  3.3441</p>
<p> LVL     22.75669	23.12856</p>
<p> RUR	0.00233	 0.00233</p>
<p> SEK	1.75948	 1.74976</p>
<p> UAH	7.20419	 7.16273</p>
<p> USD     13.398	  13.3764</p>
<p> XEU     15.56848	15.55875</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
